WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.280
Do you think finding that you’re a direct descendant has impacted your feelings toward America’s foundation?

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.380
No, just because I already . . . I mean.

3
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.560
It’s my feelings like this:

4
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.820
Every . . . I feel like almost every African American that’s in this country has some sort of an idea that “I came from slavery.”

5
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:19.760
Most likely.

6
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.740
I already had basically a knowledge that I was a descendant from slavery.

7
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:30.820
And I mean, me finding this out doesn’t necessarily change how I feel about America,

8
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:36.200
it just gives me more of a sense of where I come from and my past,

9
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.220
and actually being face-to-face with, like, the horrible things my family went through.

10
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.200
You know.

11
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.880
It’s like finally getting the answer to a question you already knew.

12
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:51.020
But once you had the answer, it’s still, like, mind-blowing.

13
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:54.180
What would you like to see come out of this discovery?

14
00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:58.500
Just finding . . . just . . . you know, more family and interconnectedness and, you know,

15
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:04.460
when you just think about how mentally and physically strong these 272 people had to be,

16
00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.120
not just to make it to the country, but to stay alive while they were owned.

17
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:14.660
Then to be sold and travel all the way across the country to a literally completely different part.

18
00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:18.400
Culturally, economically, the weather—the whole scene is different.

19
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:24.840
And how mentally and physically strong they had to be, and the bond they had to have together to stay alive with each other.

20
00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.160
The human connection part of it.
